meta {
  name: List switches remembered for this account
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/automation-connections/:automationConnection_id/remembered-settings
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  automationConnection_id: 
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  When this connection reaches an account that was disconnected in the last 30 days (the same Linear or Notion workspace, the same Jira site), the switches that account had on — `incident_tickets` (Issues for Incidents) or `incident_reports` (Postmortems) — with their `target`, its name as this connection sees it (`target_name`, null when the tool would not say), `scope` and when the offer lapses (`expires_at`). Switches this connection already has on are left out, and another account gets an empty list.

  Scope: `monitoring.read`
}
